<html lang="en">
<head>
    <title>Staging table</title>
    <style>
        h3 { ${REGULAR_LARGE_FONT_STYLE} }
        body { ${REGULAR_FONT_STYLE} }
        code { ${MONOSPACE_FONT_STYLE} }
        h3 code { font-size: inherit; }
        p { margin-top:0; }

    </style>
</head>
<body style="width: 300px">
    <h3>Embedding Destination</h3>
    <p>
        Destination table where vector embeddings were generated.<br>
        Each row represents one chunk and its associated embedding and metadata for retrieval or similarity search.
    </p>
    <br>
    <p>The destination table has the following structure:</p>
    <ul>
        <li><code>ID</code> – A unique identifier for the chunk/embedding record</li>
        <li><code>TEXT (CLOB)</code> – The chunked text segment used to generate the embedding</li>
        <li><code>EMBEDDING (VECTOR)</code> – The numeric vector representation of the text for similarity search</li>
        <li><code>METADATA (JSON)</code> – Information about the embedded content source</li>
    </ul>
</body>
</html>


